Package: assignmentB2AprilRadford
Title: Count Missing Values for All Columns by Group
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("April", "Radford", email = "april.c.radford@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Counts the missing values in every column of a data frame,
    separately for each level of a grouping column. Returns one row per
    group, making it easy to see where missing data is concentrated.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
